        "original_id": "a52b3466-3ad0-5f02-bf19-adb8bd21a527",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karl von Eberstein, Reinhard Heydrich, Heinrich Himmler\n- Organizations: Nazi Party, Sturmabteilung, Schutzstaffel\n- Roles: German nobility, paramilitary wing\n\nFacts:\n- Friedrich Karl Freiherr von Eberstein was born on 14 January 1894 and died on 10 February 1979.\n- Karl von Eberstein was a member of the German nobility.\n- Karl von Eberstein was an early member of the Nazi Party, the Sturmabteilung, and the Schutzstaffel.\n- In July 1931, Karl von Eberstein introduced Reinhard Heydrich to Heinrich Himmler.\n- The Sturmabteilung, abbreviated SA and translated as Storm Detachment, functioned as the original paramilitary wing of the Nazi Party.",
